    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "![Supern8n](https://supern8n.com/logo-icon.png)\n## Weekly Employee Feedback Tracker\n\nThis workflow collects employee feedback responses from **Google Sheets**, aggregates them for analysis, and updates the sheet to mark completed entries.\n\n1. **Get Employee Feedbacks of The Week** (Google Sheets)  \n   Fetches feedback responses from a Google Sheet.\n\n2. **Aggregate**  \n   Aggregates all feedback data for reporting or further processing.\n\n3. **Update Response Status** (Google Sheets)  \n   Marks each processed response as \"Done\" in the Google Sheet.\n",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 592
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        176,
        -432
      ],
      "id": "d94c0aeb-7eb2-4221-baae-a92d7bbdea7e",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Employee Feedback Sentiment Analysis\n\nAnalyzes employee feedback using AI sentiment analysis and sends the summarized results to HR via email.\n\n1. **Sentiment Analysis Agent** (OpenAI)  \n   Performs sentiment analysis on employee responses and generates a clear, HTML-formatted summary.\n\n2. **Send Analysis Result to HR** (Gmail)  \n   Sends the sentiment analysis report to HR as an email.\n\n",
        "height": 528,
        "width": 592
      },
